{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-309",
  "title": "Product Order Fulfilment Process (Old Stack)",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "reviewing",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Product Order Fulfilment Process (Old Stack)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Overview"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This document outlines the end-to-end order fulfillment process for an eCommerce store built on **WooCommerce** and **WordPress**, integrated with **Easyship** for shipping and logistics."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Stack"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "WooCommerce"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "WordPress"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Easyship"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Diagram"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Customer → **WooCommerce Checkout** (Stripe/PayPal; *optional Easyship rates/duties at checkout*) → **Order: Processing** → **Easyship** (rate shop, label, customs) → **Easyship → WooCommerce** (tracking + carrier/service; status to Completed/Shipped) → **WooCommerce “Order shipped” email**. *(Easyship Help, WooCommerce Docs)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "![image.png](Product%20Order%20Fulfilment%20Process%20(Old%20Stack)/image.png)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. 🛍️ Customer Places an Order"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Customer visits storefront (WordPress + WooCommerce)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Adds product(s) to cart and proceeds to checkout."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Completes payment using enabled WooCommerce gateway (e.g., Stripe, PayPal)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Order is created with status: **\"Processing\"**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. 🧾 WooCommerce Captures the Order"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Order details are stored in WooCommerce database."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Email notifications are triggered:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Customer receives confirmation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Admin/store manager is notified."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. 🔄 Sync with Easyship"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "WooCommerce–Easyship integration syncs new orders."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Order is imported into Easyship dashboard."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Easyship matches:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Shipping address"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Product weight/dimensions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Preferred carrier rules (if configured)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. 📦 Shipping Label Creation (Easyship)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Admin/staff reviews orders in Easyship."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Confirms packaging details (or automation applies presets)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Selects optimal shipping option based on:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Speed"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Cost"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Courier preferences"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Generates shipping label and customs documents (if international)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Label is downloaded or sent to connected printer."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. 🏷️ Fulfillment + Tracking"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Order is physically packed and label affixed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Courier picks up package or it is dropped off."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tracking number is auto-synced back to WooCommerce via Easyship API."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-49",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Order status in WooCommerce is updated to **\"Completed\"** or **\"Shipped\"** (depending on settings)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. 📬 Customer Notification"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-52",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Customer receives:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Shipping confirmation email"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Tracking link (via WooCommerce or Easyship's email notifications)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Optional: Branded tracking page via Easyship."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "7. 🔁 Post-Fulfillment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-59",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Order analytics are tracked in WooCommerce and Easyship."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-60",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Inventory is updated in WooCommerce (if stock management is enabled)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Optional workflows:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Request for review"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Loyalty follow-up"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Abandoned cart winbacks (for related products)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🛠️ Optional Automations & Tools"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-68",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Automation Rules** in Easyship:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Auto-select couriers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Auto-generate labels"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-72",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**WooCommerce Extensions**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Inventory syncing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Pick-and-pack slips"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-76",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Custom Plugins/Functions**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Slack/Email order alerts"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Delayed fulfillment handling"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🔍 Considerations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-82",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ensure product weights and dimensions are accurate to avoid shipping errors."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-83",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Review Easyship billing dashboard regularly to manage cost anomalies."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-84",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Regularly test checkout and fulfillment flow after plugin/theme updates."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
